   "summary": "The study measured the functional traits of saproxylic beetle species across various forest management intensities in European beech forests, using both continental and regional data. The study evaluated the effect of nearly natural management strategies on the functional diversity of saproxylic beetles by relating the functional traits of these beetle species to ecosystem characteristics across various European forest sites."
